7692,225.2 150.68363636363637,321.3333333333333 100.32382352941175,365.94117647058823 73.2109375,382.0 62.82042553191489,382.0 58.0,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"269.69612403100774\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"269.69612403100774\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.0,370.55345911949684 62.82042553191489,351.02127659574467 73.2109375,342.1875 100.32382352941175,280.29411764705884 150.68363636363637,211.03030303030303 250.9027692307692,158.0 364.0440625,137.4375 409.4947692307692,124.39999999999998\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 3% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 159 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.0\" cy=\"370.55345911949684\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 9% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 94 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"62.82042553191489\" cy=\"351.02127659574467\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 4%&amp;#10;It rained 11% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"73.2109375\" cy=\"342.1875\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 12%&amp;#10;It rained 28% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"100.32382352941175\" cy=\"280.29411764705884\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 26%&amp;#10;It rained 47% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 66 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"150.68363636363637\" cy=\"211.03030303030303\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 54%&amp;#10;It rained 62% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"250.9027692307692\" cy=\"158.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 86%&amp;#10;It rained 67% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"364.0440625\" cy=\"137.4375\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 71% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"409.4947692307692\" cy=\"124.39999999999998\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(31%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Chicago the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.40) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.00).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>172</td><td class='num'>28%</td><td class='num'>0.005</td><td class='num'>14.4%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>189</td><td class='num'>42%</td><td class='num'>0.183</td><td class='num'>15.3%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>140</td><td class='num'>24%</td><td class='num'>0.333</td><td class='num'>8.0%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>144</td><td class='num'>26%</td><td class='num'>0.396</td><td class='num'>6.4%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":41.85003,"lon":-87.65005,"n":645,"n_cities":134,"name":"Chicago","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.01,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0,"n":159,"obs":0.031446540880503145,"sig":true},{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.01,"mean":0.013617021276595745,"n":94,"obs":0.0851063829787234,"sig":true},{"hi":0.08,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.04296875,"n":64,"obs":0.109375,"sig":true},{"hi":0.17,"lo":0.08,"mean":0.11955882352941175,"n":68,"obs":0.27941176470588236,"sig":true},{"hi":0.37800000000000067,"lo":0.17,"mean":0.2618181818181818,"n":66,"obs":0.4696969696969697,"sig":true},{"hi":0.7320000000000004,"lo":0.37800000000000067,"mean":0.5449230769230768,"n":65,"obs":0.6153846153846154,"sig":false},{"hi":0.9560000000000002,"lo":0.7320000000000004,"mean":0.86453125,"n":64,"obs":0.671875,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.9560000000000002,"mean":0.9929230769230768,"n":65,"obs":0.7076923076923077,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":8.9,"provisional":false,"rank":103,"rank_hi":118.02499999999998,"rank_lo":65.0,"reliability":0.020923891609330735,"resolution":0.07152882930647239,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"chicago","station":"CHICAGO 3.6 NNW","timezone":"America/Chicago"}